# A quiet session: a one-tick market with activity behind the top and a few
# size changes at the top, but no trades. Most messages lead to no order.
#
# The book is built one side at a time, so the app starts with an invalid
# book (no asks) and must not quote until both sides exist.
#
# Participants: 2 and 3 provide the top of book, 5 adds and pulls depth.

latency market_data 5_000
latency order_entry 10_000
timer 1_000_000
end 20_000_000

# Bids first: the book has no asks yet.
0            2 enter 1 B 500 100.00
0            2 enter 2 B 400 99.99
0            2 enter 3 B 300 99.98

# Asks arrive: 100.00 x 100.01.
200_000      3 enter 1 S 500 100.01
200_000      3 enter 2 S 400 100.02
200_000      3 enter 3 S 300 100.03

# Depth comes and goes behind the top.
2_000_000    5 enter 1 B 200 99.97
2_500_000    5 enter 2 S 200 100.04
3_000_000    5 enter 3 B 100 99.96
4_000_000    5 cancel 1
5_000_000    5 enter 4 S 300 100.05
6_000_000    5 cancel 2
7_000_000    5 enter 5 B 250 99.97
8_000_000    5 cancel 3

# Size changes at the top: fair value moves, but not by enough to change
# the rounded quote prices.
9_000_000    2 cancel 1 200
10_000_000   3 enter 4 S 300 100.01
11_000_000   5 cancel 4
12_000_000   2 enter 4 B 300 100.00
13_000_000   3 cancel 1 100
14_000_000   5 enter 6 S 150 100.03
15_000_000   5 cancel 5
16_000_000   5 enter 7 B 100 99.98
17_000_000   5 cancel 6
18_000_000   5 cancel 7
